flowchart TB
    %% AgentFence enterprise deployment architecture
    subgraph ACTORS[Enterprise users and operators]
        U[Employees / customers]
        SEC[Security administrators]
        APR[Authorized approvers]
        SOC[SOC / compliance team]
    end

    subgraph AGENT_PLANE[AI agent execution plane]
        direction LR
        CLOUD[Cloud AI agents<br/>copilots · workflows · serverless agents]
        LOCAL[Local browser agent<br/>managed laptop or VDI]
        WRAPPER[AgentFence browser wrapper<br/>extension · proxy · automation adapter]
        CLOUD -->|tool intent| GATEWAY
        LOCAL -->|navigation · form · upload · API intent| WRAPPER
        WRAPPER -->|intercepted browser action| GATEWAY
    end

    subgraph FENCE[AgentFence control plane and runtime enforcement]
        direction TB
        GATEWAY[Tool Gateway / signed runtime SDK<br/>single action decision point]
        IDENTITY[Agent Registry and workload identity<br/>tenant · owner · environment · risk]
        POLICY[Policy Engine<br/>allow · block · approval]
        GUARD[Data Guard<br/>PII · PHI · payment data · secrets]
        APPROVAL[Human Approval Workflow<br/>payments · deletes · exports · record changes]
        CREDS[Credential Broker<br/>scoped short-lived credentials]
        AUDIT[Tamper-Evident Audit Ledger<br/>decision · actor · tool · outcome]
        MONITOR[Runtime Monitoring and Notifications]
        SIM[Controlled OWASP assessment<br/>synthetic only · no payload execution]

        GATEWAY -->|resolve agent| IDENTITY
        GATEWAY -->|evaluate requested action| POLICY
        GATEWAY -->|classify input / output| GUARD
        POLICY -->|high-impact action| APPROVAL
        POLICY -->|allowed action scope| CREDS
        GATEWAY -->|all decisions| AUDIT
        AUDIT --> MONITOR
        SIM -->|tests policy boundary| POLICY
        SIM --> AUDIT
    end

    subgraph TRUST[Corporate trust services]
        IDP[Corporate IdP / SSO<br/>workforce and workload identity]
        VAULT[Dedicated Vault / secret manager<br/>AppRole · leases · rotation · revocation]
        SIEM[SIEM / SOAR / compliance evidence]
        IDP -->|authenticated user and agent claims| GATEWAY
        VAULT -->|server-side dynamic lease| CREDS
        AUDIT -->|immutable events| SIEM
        MONITOR -->|alerts| SOC
    end

    subgraph ENTERPRISE[Approved enterprise systems and data]
        direction LR
        SAAS[CRM · ERP · ITSM · HRIS<br/>approved SaaS applications]
        API[Internal APIs and microservices]
        DATA[Databases · data warehouse · file storage]
        PAY[Payments · banking · regulated workflows]
        WEB[Approved business websites / browser portals]
        CREDS -->|scoped credential, only after allow| SAAS
        CREDS -->|scoped credential, only after allow| API
        CREDS -->|scoped credential, only after allow| DATA
        CREDS -->|scoped credential, only after allow| PAY
        GATEWAY -->|approved browser action only| WEB
    end

    subgraph GOVERNANCE[Administration and governance]
        CONSOLE[AgentFence Console<br/>registry · policies · approvals · evidence]
        SEC --> CONSOLE
        APR -->|approve or reject| APPROVAL
        CONSOLE --> IDENTITY
        CONSOLE --> POLICY
        CONSOLE --> APPROVAL
        CONSOLE --> AUDIT
        CONSOLE --> SIM
    end

    U --> CLOUD
    U --> LOCAL

    classDef agent fill:#1d2939,stroke:#77d9ef,color:#eef9ff,stroke-width:2px
    classDef control fill:#4a1024,stroke:#ff849e,color:#fff3f6,stroke-width:3px
    classDef security fill:#17233a,stroke:#8adff0,color:#edfaff,stroke-width:2px
    classDef system fill:#182319,stroke:#74d7a5,color:#effff5,stroke-width:2px
    classDef people fill:#281b32,stroke:#c7a7ff,color:#fbf6ff,stroke-width:2px

    class CLOUD,LOCAL,WRAPPER agent
    class GATEWAY,IDENTITY,POLICY,GUARD,APPROVAL,CREDS,AUDIT,MONITOR,SIM control
    class IDP,VAULT,SIEM security
    class SAAS,API,DATA,PAY,WEB system
    class U,SEC,APR,SOC,CONSOLE people
